              "exploit_scenario": "A token leaks via a server/proxy access log entry shortly after issuance. Before the legitimate client's single consumption completes its RemoveAsync call, an attacker who scraped the log replays the same token and both the legitimate client and the attacker establish live SSE streams receiving the same user's real-time events.",
